      "subject": "Indonesian answer",
      "conclusion": "\"pemilik rekening\" is an ordinary, accurate Indonesian banking term, but \"pemegang rekening\" is also used for the account holder in Indonesian banking and regulatory contexts.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://e-form.kbbanksyariah.co.id/eformbsb/term/5",
