        "https://www.bsn.com.my/page/operate-account-by-representative?lang=ms-MY"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Final relation",
      "conclusion": "The label \"different-common-word\" is too strong as a national distinction. The forms differ orthographically (rekening versus akaun), but ordinary accepted equivalents overlap across varieties; a shared-synonym or non-exclusive preference relation is more accurate.",
