      "subject": "False-friend contrast",
      "conclusion": "No false-friend contrast is warranted: the two terms transparently refer to the same banking concept, with lexical variation rather than misleading cross-variety meanings. The empty contrast is acceptable if no contrast field is required, but the card should not imply exclusivity.",
